Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?bsp/abstract-machine:=20=E6=8E=A5=E5=85=A5=20ri?=
 =?UTF-8?q?scv32e-ysyxsoc=20=E5=B9=B3=E5=8F=B0=E5=B9=B6=E5=AE=9E=E7=8E=B0?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20RT-Thread=20=E4=B8=8A=E4=B8=8B=E6=96=87=E5=88=87=E6=8D=A2?=
